def add(k,zh,en,reason,mechanic,source='author-revision-original.txt; user latest Southern canon; original ce_usm_events/flavorUSM.4.d, ce_usm_conflicts_within_reason'):
    P[k]={'zh':zh,'en':en,'reason':reason,'source':source,'mechanic':mechanic}
def short(k,zh,en,reason='统一本轮设定与名称，保持原有数值和功能。',mechanic='仅改名称/显示；效果不变。'):
    add(k,zh,en,reason,mechanic)
# Huguang author drafts. The old JE is retired; proposals preserve the author's political content without claiming that they are live.
short('nesnd_hna_academy','湖广联合书院','Huguang United Academies')
short('nesnd_hna_supply','军工粮运协定','Arms and Grain Agreement')
short('nesnd_hna_veterans','老兵集会','Veterans’ Assemblies')
short('nesnd_hna_prepared','地方防卫准备','Local Defence Preparations')
short('nesnd_huguang_preparations','襄阳之后','After Xiangyang')
add('nesnd_huguang_preparations_reason','朱班博整顿湖广时曾修复襄阳工事，召集青年军官任教，又用军工铁件向川蜀换取粮食。伤兵与退伍军人分入后勤、屯垦卫所，留在襄阳的共和派协助总督府改造岳麓书院。二十年间，总督府掌握的军队、田赋与书院渐成一体，朝中又有陈东阳为奥援。时人多以襄阳兵为“新西府”的魁首，南明联邦也不能缺少这根柱石。\\n\\n然而，曾经极力支持朱班博的郑家如今屡屡指责襄阳拖欠税款、瞒报户籍。石元辅、林汉涵等亲近湖广的南兵高层相继外调，朝中与我们交好的共和派官员也受到排挤。我们必须做好最坏的准备：重新核定屯田兵农丁口，接续上游粮运，并争取书院中即将步入政坛的监生。','When Zhu Banbo reorganised Huguang, he repaired the fortifications of Xiangyang, brought young officers into teaching, and exchanged military ironware for grain from Sichuan. Wounded and retired soldiers entered supply services and farming garrisons. Republicans who remained in Xiangyang helped the governor-general reform Yuelu Academy. Over twenty years, the army, land revenues and academies became closely bound to his government, with Chen Dongyang supporting it at court. Xiangyang’s troops came to be regarded as the leaders of the New Western Administration, an indispensable pillar of the Southern Ming federation.\\n\\nThe Zheng family once supported Zhu Banbo vigorously. Now it repeatedly accuses Xiangyang of withholding taxes and concealing households. Southern officers friendly to Huguang, including Shi Yuanfu and Lin Hanhan, have been posted away, while our republican allies at court face exclusion. We must prepare for the worst: reassess the soldiers and farming households of the garrisons, restore grain shipments from upriver, and win over the academy students who will soon enter political life.','保留作者对西府政治根基和郑氏排挤的叙述；学政不作学籍/教育机关；朱斑博统一为朱班博。','DORMANT: common/journal_entries/nesnd_regional_preparations.txt:2 的possible=no。作者设定可用于HNA后续内容，不能称当前可玩。')
short('nesnd_hna_academy_button','整顿联合书院','Reorganise the United Academies')
add('nesnd_hna_academy_button_desc','襄阳的岳麓书院是湖广官员与议政士子的精神中心。院中监生一面读书，一面习议国事，日后须通过礼议院的考试，才能进入南朝政坛。书院自创办以来便以忠于南朝训育诸生，如今南府步步相逼，我们须让教员讲明：把持朝政的郑吴与朱明皇室并非一体。今日在讲席间争取到的士子，或许就是来日同我们共进退的学政。','Yuelu Academy in Xiangyang is the intellectual centre of Huguang’s officials and aspiring politicians. Its students study and debate public affairs before taking the examinations of the Liyi Assembly to enter Southern political life. Loyalty to the Southern realm has guided their education since the academy’s foundation. With the Southern Administration pressing us at every turn, its teachers must distinguish the Zheng rulers who dominate the government from the Zhu imperial house. Students won over in the lecture hall today may stand with us as provincial representatives tomorrow.','按最新用户设定重写政治教育因果；不把书院降格为粮饷培训；考试只叙述制度，不冒称按钮有考试机制。','DORMANT button; existing effect gives preparation +30 and 120-month education-access modifier, no stance conversion or student simulation.')
short('nesnd_hna_supply_button','荆蜀密室之约','The Secret Jing–Shu Agreement')
add('nesnd_hna_supply_button_desc','抗击牧贼时，湖广的工坊与川蜀的粮船曾共同供养襄阳军民。如今南府与西府的裂痕日深，我们应当重新联络川中旧交，依两省所需组织军工与粮运，启用战时的沿江转运库。奸臣若要发难，襄阳总得有粮有械。','Huguang’s workshops and Sichuan’s grain boats sustained Xiangyang when we fought the Mu forces. As the divide between the Southern and Western Administrations deepens, we should renew our contacts in Sichuan, coordinate arms and grain supplies between the two provinces, and reopen the wartime depots along the river. If the ministers who threaten us make their move, Xiangyang must have food and weapons.','保留作者政治口吻与真实省际协定；此处约不是宪法，不能机械改为礼法。','DORMANT button; +30 preparation and 120-month defence/military-wage modifier; no actual bilateral treaty or goods transfer.')
short('nesnd_hna_veterans_button','使老兵集会待命','Call the Veterans’ Assemblies to Readiness')
add('nesnd_hna_veterans_button_desc','朱班博治楚时，楚兵待遇已远优于南朝友军。他又仿照北朝规定退伍年限、组织老兵集会，使受过训练的退伍士兵带领垦丁充实乡里，改善久困于战火的湖广民生。如今各地集会已有根基，老兵既熟悉营伍，也熟悉乡里。召集他们筹办粮食、救济与后勤，战时动员便可有所依凭。','Under Zhu Banbo, Chu soldiers enjoyed better conditions than their Southern allies. He also borrowed northern practices of fixed service terms and veterans’ assemblies, sending trained former soldiers to lead farming settlers and rebuild communities exhausted by war. These assemblies are now well established. Their veterans know both the army and the countryside; calling them together to organise food, relief and supplies will give wartime mobilisation a firm local foundation.','保留作者退伍组织与社会改革主题；删除冗余断句。','DORMANT button; +30 preparation and 120-month turmoil-effects/wage modifier; no actual demographic resettlement.')
short('nesnd_hna_academy_button_requirements','尚未整顿联合书院；[concept_bureaucracy]不为负。','The United Academies have not yet been reorganised, and [concept_bureaucracy] is not negative.','旧提示误称军校；按现有按钮flag修正。')
short('nesnd_hna_veterans_button_requirements','尚未召集老兵集会；[concept_bureaucracy]不为负。','The veterans’ assemblies have not yet been called, and [concept_bureaucracy] is not negative.','旧提示误称整编老营。')
short('nesnd_huguang_preparations_status','完成书院、粮运、老兵集会三项准备，每项#v 30#!点；达到#v 90#!点后获得#v 10年#!地方防卫收益。','Complete the academy, grain supply and veterans’ assembly preparations, worth #v 30#! each. Reaching #v 90#! grants local defence benefits for #v 10 years#!.','更新组织名称；保留旧机制说明作为闲置键。','DORMANT JE; must not revive merely to expose prose.')
# Live constitutional settlement and diplomatic consent must remain distinct.
short('nesnd_federal_compact','礼法定制','Constitutional Settlement','此修正是明廷内部权力约束，不是国际宗盟。','common/static_modifiers/nesnd_crisis_modifiers.txt: country_authority_mult=-0.15, government_wages=+0.10; Ming peaceful outcome applies 120 months.')
short('nesnd_federal_compact_button','重订国家礼法','Revise the Constitution','作者旧按钮名保留为兼容键；真实按钮引用south_offer。')
short('nesnd_south_offer_accord','遣使议定改制','Seek Consent for Constitutional Reform')
add('nesnd_south_offer_accord_desc','南朝的任官、赋额与军费须有共同遵守的礼法。先将本方的改制主张送交各省与海外诸邦，争取他们对新秩序的支持。','Appointments, taxation and military funding require a constitution that the Southern realm can uphold. Send our proposed settlement to the provinces and overseas states to seek their support.','中性回退，只说明当前按钮发送提案；不宣称点击就通过宪法。','Live nesnd_south_offer_accord button -> nesnd_south_offer_chosen_accord; side1/2 sends event1 after3days; 6month cooldown and negotiation cost.')
add('nesnd_federal_compact_button_desc','新政已使南朝无法退回旧日的藩镇格局，杭州南府也不能再独断国政。各省学政将在礼议院议定任官、赋额、军费与省制，内阁及六部则须依新定礼法施政。我们应先遣使争取西府各省与海外诸邦的支持，使朱姓天子摆脱南府的挟持，依礼法主持国政。','Reform has carried the Southern realm beyond the old order of military fiefs. Hangzhou can no longer decide its government alone. Provincial representatives will debate appointments, taxation, military funding and provincial powers in the Liyi Assembly, while the cabinet and Six Ministries must govern under the revised constitution. We should first seek support from the Western provinces and overseas states, allowing the Zhu sovereign to govern constitutionally, free of the Southern Administration’s domination.','采用作者拥明主张；内阁六部、一院制礼议院；把即时效果写为遣使争取支持。','NEW LIVE WIRING NEEDED: select when nesnd_board_stance_value=1; this text is presently dormant.')
add('nesnd_federal_compact_button_alt_desc','新政已使南朝无法退回旧日的藩镇格局，而杭州南府仍掌握着推行新政所需的兵财。易代改姓的时机已然成熟。我们应先遣使争取各省与海外诸邦，再请礼议院与内阁议定任官、赋额、军费、省制以及朱明皇室的地位。以礼法确立君权与议政之权，为郑氏称制奠定国制。','Reform has carried the Southern realm beyond the old order of military fiefs, while Hangzhou still commands the troops and revenues needed to sustain it. The time has come for a new dynasty. We should first seek the consent of the provinces and overseas states, then bring appointments, taxation, military funding, provincial powers and the position of the Zhu house before the Liyi Assembly and cabinet. A constitution defining the powers of sovereign and assembly will lay the foundations of Zheng rule.','将作者注释掉的吴支线变成独立有效键；不写吴朝民主联邦；不假设称帝已发生。','NEW LIVE WIRING NEEDED: select when nesnd_board_stance_value=2, not tag_WUU_var (Wu choice precedes accession).')
short('nesnd_south_offer_available_tt','已选择拥明或拥吴，朝争尚未决裂；本国未[concept_default]且不在战争中，距上次遣使已满六个月，并有可以答复的诸邦。','The court supports Ming or Wu, the crisis has not reached open conflict, and the country is neither at war nor in [concept_default]. Six months have passed since the last mission, and an eligible state can respond.','in_default不是违约；保留实际门槛。','nesnd_south_can_offer_accord trigger.')
short('nesnd_south_accord_offer_tt','向可以接洽的各省与诸邦提出改制条款，由对方决定是否接受。#v 6个月#!内不能再次遣使；议约期间政府工资#n +3%#!、[concept_authority]#n −25#!。','Send the proposed settlement to eligible provinces and states for their acceptance or refusal. Another mission may be sent after #v 6 months#!. Negotiations increase government wages by #n 3%#! and use #n 25#! [concept_authority].','保留发送行为和实际成本，区分国家礼法与各方同意。')
short('nesnd_board_compact_bar_name','改制承诺','Support for the Settlement')
short('nesnd_board_compact_bar_desc','各方承诺：#v [JournalEntry.GetCurrentBarValue(ScriptedProgressBar.Self)|1] / 100#!','Commitments: #v [JournalEntry.GetCurrentBarValue(ScriptedProgressBar.Self)|1] / 100#!')
short('nesnd_south_compact_bar','改制承诺','Support for the Settlement')
short('nesnd_south_compact_bar_desc','改制承诺：#v [JournalEntry.GetCurrentBarValue(ScriptedProgressBar.Self)|0] / 100#!　#tooltippable #tooltip:[JournalEntry.GetCountry.GetTooltipTag],nesnd_south_compact_detail_tt 议定条件#!#!','Commitments: #v [JournalEntry.GetCurrentBarValue(ScriptedProgressBar.Self)|0] / 100#!　#tooltippable #tooltip:[JournalEntry.GetCountry.GetTooltipTag],nesnd_south_compact_detail_tt Settlement requirements#!#!')
short('nesnd_south_accords.1.t','南朝改制之议','The Southern Constitutional Settlement')
add('nesnd_south_accords.1.ming','内阁的使者来到[ROOT.GetCountry.GetName]，请求我们支持保全明统的改制主张。南朝将以礼法划定中央与各省的权力，朱氏天子继续主持国政，内阁及六部依法施政，各省学政在礼议院参预国事。\\n\\n对本国而言，接受提议意味着承认朱明统绪，并支持这一安排。本国的政府、辖地与现行法制仍予保留；涉及海外诸邦的宗属和通商关系，另依彼此所立条约办理。','The cabinet’s envoy has arrived in [ROOT.GetCountry.GetName] to seek our support for a settlement preserving the Ming dynasty. A constitution will define the powers of the centre and provinces. The Zhu sovereign will remain at the head of government, the cabinet and Six Ministries will administer under law, and provincial representatives will participate through the Liyi Assembly.\\n\\nAcceptance commits our government to the Zhu succession and this settlement. We retain our government, territory and existing laws. The status and commerce of overseas states will continue to be governed by their separate treaties.','用宪法说明中央内部制度；明确不自动吞并、不直接改变各成员法律；真实外交条约保留。','event1 pending_side=1; accept sets stance1/36monthaccord/relations+15, no actual legal enactment.')
add('nesnd_south_accords.1.integration','南府使者提出的条件十分明确：承认郑氏易代，并将本国在中国的辖地改设为中央直接治理的行省。地方原有的独立军政权将随之收回，任官、赋额与军费纳入新朝礼法，由内阁及六部统筹。\\n\\n这将使南府多年推动的集权变法取得最后的成果。我们一旦答允，便是在替本地决定日后由谁施政、向谁纳税。若本国另有海外辖地，那里的政府和疆界仍予保留。','The Southern Administration’s envoy offers clear terms: recognise Zheng accession and place our Chinese territories under direct central administration as provinces. Their separate military and political authority will end; appointments, taxation and military funding will fall under the new dynasty’s constitution and the cabinet and Six Ministries.\\n\\nThis would complete the centralising reforms long pursued by Hangzhou. Accepting means deciding who will govern and tax these lands. If our country also holds territory overseas, its government and boundaries there will be retained.','删除簿册移交流水账；说明真实主权代价；只写接受条款，尚未即时转移领土。','event1 pending_side2+integration_member. Consent grants future integration flag; actual transfer only commit_wu after12months+allgates.')
add('nesnd_south_accords.1.japan','南府使者要求本国承认郑氏取代朱明，并将实际持有的四国、九州辖地交由吴朝直接治理，其余领土仍由本国政府掌管。\\n\\n这份提议把南朝的易代与日本的疆界连在了一起。接受它可以换取新秩序中的名位，却也意味着放弃这些土地。朝廷与诸家须先认清代价，才能向杭州作答。','The Southern Administration asks us to recognise the Zheng succession and surrender any territory we hold in Shikoku and Kyushu to direct Wu rule. Our government would retain its remaining lands.\\n\\nThe proposal ties a Southern dynastic succession to Japan’s borders. Acceptance would secure our place in the new order, at the cost of those territories. The court and the great houses must weigh that price before answering Hangzhou.','实际日本割地条件是外交条款，仍保留；不把未来吴政权叫现成新朝。','event1 pending_side2+japan; actual transfer on Wu peaceful commit, owner-controlled states only; remainingcapitalguard.')
add('nesnd_south_accords.1.overseas','南府使者请[ROOT.GetCountry.GetName]承认郑氏的新名位，并表示本国的政府、辖地与现有宗属安排均可延续。南朝内部如何以礼法重定君权和省权，将由其礼议院与内阁办理；我国与它的通商、港务和军费往来，仍须依各项条约行事。\\n\\n郑氏需要海内外的支持。我们也应在作答以前想清楚，这次易代将给本国留下怎样的位置。','The Southern Administration asks [ROOT.GetCountry.GetName] to recognise the Zheng succession while retaining our government, territory and existing status. The Liyi Assembly and cabinet will settle the Southern constitution’s distribution of sovereign and provincial powers. Our commerce, ports and military obligations will remain matters for separate treaties.\\n\\nThe Zheng family needs recognition at home and overseas. Before answering, we must consider the place this succession would leave for our country.','保留国际承认/宗属/条约，不以礼法替换外交安排。','event1 Wu overseas fallback; no integration/concession flag unless classified appropriate member.')
short('nesnd_south_accords.1.a','赞同改制，奉此正朔。','Support the settlement and recognise the succession.')
short('nesnd_south_accords.1.b','接受改省，归中央统治。','Accept provincial integration under the central government.')
short('nesnd_south_accords.1.c','承认易代，接受割地。','Recognise the succession and accept the territorial cession.')
short('nesnd_south_accords.1.d','暂不答允。','Withhold our consent.')
short('nesnd_south_accord_accept_tt','本国支持所提路线，承诺有效#v 36个月#!，立场在#v 6个月#!内固定。改换立场、与南朝中央交战、改投其他宗主或承诺到期后，支持失效。吴方改省条款包括交出本国在中国的辖地；日本条款包括交出本国持有的四国、九州，保留其他辖地。与中央关系#p +15#!。','Support the proposed settlement for #v 36 months#!, with alignment fixed for #v 6 months#!. Changing alignment, fighting the Southern central government, joining another overlord or expiry ends the commitment. Wu integration terms cede our Chinese territories; Japanese terms cede our holdings in Shikoku and Kyushu while retaining other lands. Relations with the centre improve by #p 15#!.','旧文“对吴交战”漏掉明廷；保留36/6/15及真实割地风险。')
short('nesnd_south_leave_accord','撤回改制承诺','Withdraw Our Commitment')
short('nesnd_south_leave_accord_desc','撤回对改制条款的同意，重新决定本国与南朝中央的关系。','Withdraw our consent to the settlement and reconsider our relationship with the Southern central government.')
short('nesnd_south_accord_leave_tt','撤回改制承诺及尚未执行的改省、割地同意；与中央关系#n −15#!，#v 6个月#!内不能改换立场。','Withdraw the commitment and any unfulfilled consent to integration or cession. Relations with the centre fall by #n 15#!; alignment cannot change for #v 6 months#!.')
short('nesnd_board_stance_effect_tt','公开本国立场，#v 6个月#!内不再更改。撤回既有承诺时，尚未执行的改省或割地同意一并作废，与中央关系#n −15#!。','Declare our alignment, fixed for #v 6 months#!. Withdrawing an existing commitment also cancels unfulfilled consent to integration or cession and reduces relations with the centre by #n 15#!.')
short('nesnd_south_accords.20.t','重定礼法','Revising the Constitution')
add('nesnd_south_accords.20.d','一年来，支持明统的各省与诸邦维持了对改制的承诺。礼议院中各省学政所议的任官、田赋与军费条陈，如今已有推行的基础。内阁请[ROOT.GetCountry.GetRuler.GetPrimaryRoleTitle][ROOT.GetCountry.GetRuler.GetFullName]颁诏，将中央与各省的权责载入国家礼法。\\n\\n自陈东阳重设行省布政司以来，南朝已能统一调度军政，旧封君的名位却仍牵动地方势力。过去因抗击北朝而暂且搁置的争执，终于可以在礼议院作成定议。朱明统绪得以保全，天子、内阁与各省也须各依礼法行使职权。','For a year, the provinces and states supporting Ming have upheld their commitment to reform. The provisions debated by provincial representatives in the Liyi Assembly on appointments, land taxes and military funding now have a basis for enactment. The cabinet asks [ROOT.GetCountry.GetRuler.GetPrimaryRoleTitle] [ROOT.GetCountry.GetRuler.GetFullName] to proclaim a constitution defining the powers of the centre and provinces.\\n\\nSince Chen Dongyang restored provincial administrative commissions, the Southern government has coordinated civil and military affairs, but the titles of former feudal lords still sustain local influence. Disputes set aside during resistance to the North can at last be settled in the assembly. The Zhu succession will endure, with sovereign, cabinet and provinces each exercising authority under the constitution.','接收作者event10历史论说，放到真实明和平确认事件；改绝对多数、彻底结束割据/万世难改等超出机制断言。','Live event20 requires real authorized Zhu ruler, Ming strength85/lead20/accord75,2mainland,12months,peace/fiscal/supply; .20 acceptance preserves members and applies constitutional constraint.')
short('nesnd_south_accords.20.a','颁诏施行礼法。','Proclaim the constitution.')
short('nesnd_south_accords.21.t','以礼法定易代','A Constitution for the Succession')
add('nesnd_south_accords.21.d','支持郑氏的各方已将改制主张维持了一年。拟改设行省的各国同意交出在中国的辖地，日本诸政权也已接受有关四国、九州的条件。南府所掌兵财因此有了推行新制的依凭。\\n\\n礼议院与内阁将把任官、赋额、军费和省制纳入新朝礼法，重新规定君权与议政之权。郑氏若在此时受禅，就须接下这些已经许诺的责任。旧日借明廷名义施政的南府，终于要以自己的国号面对天下。','The parties supporting Zheng have sustained their commitment to reform for a year. States due for provincial integration have accepted the transfer of their Chinese territories, and the Japanese governments have accepted the terms concerning Shikoku and Kyushu. Hangzhou’s military and fiscal power now has a basis for establishing the new order.\\n\\nThe Liyi Assembly and cabinet will incorporate appointments, taxation, military funding and provincial government into a new constitution defining the powers of monarch and assembly. If the Zheng family accepts the throne, it must also accept these obligations. The Southern Administration, long governing in Ming’s name, will face the world under its own dynasty.','吴二元君主制；精确只断言中国范围整合同意+日本条件，不能称所有海外同意。','event21 -> commit_wu; sets ruler/tag_WUU_var and integrates consenting Chinese states; no explicit law enactment so constitutional form is narrative canon, not claimed lawgroup transition.')
short('nesnd_south_accords.21.a','受禅建国，依礼法施政。','Accept the throne and govern under the constitution.')
short('nesnd_south_accords.reconsider','暂缓定议，再行会商。','Defer the settlement and reopen deliberations.','删除“重新计算履约期”开发腔；必须另保留重置12月的操作后果。','Add custom_tooltip nesnd_south_reconsider_tt to both reconsider options.')
short('nesnd_south_reconsider_tt','重新开始#v 12个月#!的连续履行期。','Restart the #v 12-month#! period of continuous fulfilment.','新增真实代价tooltip，选项只说行动。','Event20/21 reconsider already resets month count/observation flags; append custom_tooltip only.')
short('nesnd_south_accords.22.t','礼法既定','The Constitution Established')
add('nesnd_south_accords.22.d','[ROOT.GetCountry.GetRuler.GetPrimaryRoleTitle][ROOT.GetCountry.GetRuler.GetFullName]已颁诏施行新定礼法。各省学政在礼议院参预国政，内阁与六部承担中央施政之责，行省布政司依定议办理地方事务。朱明皇室从南府挟持下争得了施政的余地，也接受了礼法对君权的约束。\\n\\n这场改制保全了南明的儒家立宪联邦。各省及海外诸邦仍有自己的政府与辖地，而中央必须承担维持新制的经费。南、西两府昔日依兵力争执的权责，如今有了共同认可的裁断依据。','[ROOT.GetCountry.GetRuler.GetPrimaryRoleTitle] [ROOT.GetCountry.GetRuler.GetFullName] has proclaimed the revised constitution. Provincial representatives participate in the Liyi Assembly; the cabinet and Six Ministries conduct central government; provincial administrative commissions administer local affairs under the settlement. The Zhu house has gained room to govern beyond Hangzhou’s domination, while accepting constitutional limits on the sovereign.\\n\\nThe settlement preserves Southern Ming’s Confucian constitutional federation. Its provinces and overseas states retain their governments and territories, and the centre assumes the expense of maintaining the new institutions. Powers once contested by the Southern and Western Administrations through military strength now have an agreed constitutional basis.','真实颁诏者动态标题姓名；一院制、不写中央宗盟。保留作者宏观政治过程。','After commit_ming; no territory/government/economiclaw changes to member states; 120months authority-15%, wages+10%.')
short('nesnd_south_accords.23.t','吴朝立国','The Wu Dynasty Established')
add('nesnd_south_accords.23.d','[ROOT.GetCountry.GetRuler.GetPrimaryRoleTitle][ROOT.GetCountry.GetRuler.GetFullName]已登基称制，并颁诏施行新朝礼法。接受改省的中国辖地由中央接管，日本方面依约交出的四国、九州也归入吴朝统治。仍保有疆土的海外诸邦继续自行施政，与新朝另循既有条约往来。\\n\\n礼议院的议政之权与郑氏的君权共同列入国制，内阁及六部据此主持政务。自郑昭以来数代人用军队、工商业和海外经营积累的权势，如今终于成为郑氏自己的帝国。','[ROOT.GetCountry.GetRuler.GetPrimaryRoleTitle] [ROOT.GetCountry.GetRuler.GetFullName] has taken the throne and proclaimed the Wu constitution. The centre has assumed administration of the Chinese territories that accepted integration, together with the lands ceded in Shikoku and Kyushu. Overseas states retaining their territories continue to govern themselves and deal with the new dynasty under their existing treaties.\\n\\nThe constitution recognises both the deliberative powers of the Liyi Assembly and the sovereign authority of the Zheng monarch, with the cabinet and Six Ministries conducting government accordingly. Generations of military power, commerce and overseas expansion since Zheng Zhao have at last become an empire ruled in the Zheng family’s own name.','实际新吴君主的标题/姓名；不把所有海外吞并；二元君主立宪政治结果。','After commit_wu sets monarch and tag; cessions only authorized/control-safe states; original provinces gain12monthtransitionmodifier.')
short('nesnd_south_accords.done','依礼法施行。','Govern according to the constitution.')
short('nesnd_south_ming_peace_result_tt','保全朱氏君主与明廷国号，各成员保留现有领土、政府和经济法律。中央承担#v 10年#!礼法约束；履行承诺者获得有期限的声望收益，筹备充足者另获奖励。','Preserve the Zhu sovereign and Ming state. Members retain their territories, governments and economic laws. The centre accepts constitutional obligations for #v 10 years#!. States honouring their commitments receive temporary prestige benefits, with an additional reward for sufficient preparations.','删除“真实”实现口吻，明确仍是游戏成员政府不变。')
short('nesnd_south_negotiation_cost','改制会商','Constitutional Negotiations')
short('nesnd_south_accord_respected','践行改制承诺','Settlement Honoured')
short('nesnd_south_failed_alignment','失势的主张','A Defeated Political Cause')
short('nesnd_south_new_province','行省接管','Provincial Transition')
short('nesnd_south_retry_confrontation','再提地方交涉','Renew Negotiations with the Provinces')
add('nesnd_south_retry_confrontation_desc','前次交涉未成，反对新朝的地方仍据地拥兵。再次提出交涉，要求他们就朝廷的统治权作出答复。','The previous negotiations failed, and opponents of the new dynasty still command their own territory and troops. Reopen the confrontation and demand an answer concerning the central government’s authority.','各府改为地方，不误称布政司为独立府。','button directly nesnd_open_southern_war; existing diplomaticplay not peaceful envoys only.')
# Court and broad narrative terminology: Nanjing is the imperial seat; Hangzhou is the Southern Administration, not a second chamber.
add('nesnd_south_succession_board_reason','南朝的天下，究竟是朱氏皇帝的天下，还是郑氏开拓出来的天下？南京仍有朱明的帝统，杭州南府则掌握着推行新政的兵财。西府各省与南府共同抵御北朝时，尚能把君臣名分的争论留待来日；如今改革已深入地方，两方再不能回避谁来主持国政。\\n\\n湖广的书院和襄樊的营伍奉朱氏正朔，四川的共和派仍在议论南府的新政。南洋总督与日本诸侯也在衡量易代将向他们索取多少土地、钱粮和兵员。礼议院中的学政、内阁中的大臣以及各省带兵的将领，终须为自己的主张承担后果。','Whose realm is Southern Ming: the Zhu emperor’s, or the Zheng family’s creation? Nanjing retains the imperial succession, while the Southern Administration in Hangzhou commands the troops and revenues that sustain reform. The Western provinces and Hangzhou could postpone their dispute over sovereign and minister while resisting the North. With reform reaching deep into provincial life, they can no longer avoid the question of who will govern.\\n\\nHuguang’s academies and Xiangfan’s troops uphold the Zhu succession, while Sichuan’s republicans continue to debate the Southern Administration’s reforms. Governors in the Southern Seas and lords in Japan weigh the land, money and soldiers a new dynasty might demand. Representatives in the Liyi Assembly, ministers in the cabinet and provincial commanders will eventually have to answer for their choices.','去同一张案/账册隐喻；区分西府与南府；保留作者论争社会范围。','Board narrative; current HNA fixed Ming; generic others no unimplemented probabilities.')
short('nesnd_south_succession_board_status','各省与海外诸邦正在表明立场，整顿军政。南朝的国制之争已牵动海内外。','The provinces and overseas states are declaring their positions and preparing their governments and forces. The dispute over Southern government now reaches across the seas.')
short('nesnd_board_choose_ming_desc','朱氏帝统仍是南朝诸省与海外诸邦共同奉行的正朔。支持明廷依礼法主持国政，约束南府独断之权。','The Zhu succession remains the recognised authority of the Southern provinces and overseas states. Support Ming government under the constitution and limits on Hangzhou’s dominance.')
short('nesnd_board_choose_wu_desc','郑氏经营海陆、掌握兵财已久。支持吴王以今日功业改定帝统，并以礼法确立新朝的君权与议政之权。','The Zheng family has long commanded the Southern realm’s military and fiscal power. Support the King of Wu in founding a dynasty whose constitution defines the powers of monarch and assembly.')
short('nesnd_board_choose_neutral_desc','明廷与南府各有主张。本国暂不参与易代之争，先照顾自己的商路与防务。','The Ming court and Hangzhou press rival claims. Remain outside the succession dispute for now and attend to our own trade and defence.')
short('nesnd_board_choose_autonomy_desc','朝廷正在争论易代，本国也当争取自行决定财赋、任官与防务。向明吴两方说明我们的主张。','As the court disputes the succession, seek control of our own taxation, appointments and defence. Make our position clear to both Ming and Wu.')
short('nesnd_south_status_qin','吴王仍在约束近臣的易代之议，明廷与南府的争论却一日紧过一日。\\n#tooltippable #tooltip:[ROOT.GetCountry.GetTooltipTag],nesnd_south_rules 朝争进展#!#!','The King of Wu still restrains calls for accession among his followers, but the dispute with the Ming court grows sharper.\\n#tooltippable #tooltip:[ROOT.GetCountry.GetTooltipTag],nesnd_south_rules The court dispute#!#!')
short('nesnd_south_status_succession','南府已在催促改定帝统，明廷与各省仍在争取自己的主张。\\n#tooltippable #tooltip:[ROOT.GetCountry.GetTooltipTag],nesnd_south_rules 朝争进展#!#!','The Southern Administration presses for a new dynasty, while the Ming court and provinces defend their positions.\\n#tooltippable #tooltip:[ROOT.GetCountry.GetTooltipTag],nesnd_south_rules The court dispute#!#!','状态只描述现状；日期门槛已由规则提示承担，不预告所有案件必然结束。')
short('nesnd_ming_host_effect_tt','诸省与中央决裂时，优先在此建立行在；无法接驾时，再考虑另一处接应地。','When the provinces break with the centre, establish the court in refuge here if possible; otherwise consider the other available host.','删除“目标失效/另一核心”内部术语。')
short('nesnd_ming_renew_convocation_desc','召集各省与诸邦的代表，重新商议明廷与吴王的名位。','Summon representatives of the provinces and states to reconsider the positions of the Ming court and the King of Wu.')
add('nesnd_ming_court.3.d','随驾臣僚已经抵达行在，地方政府正在安置朝廷。原有军队仍须征饷调兵，布政司仍须治理各地，如今又要供给天子的行朝。拥明的主张由此有了可以奉事的中央，也使接驾之地首先承担了同南府决裂的代价。\\n\\n各省与海外诸邦还在遣使往来。曾经在礼议院与内阁争执的名分，如今已须由彼此的军力担保。','The accompanying ministers have reached the court’s refuge, and the local government is making room for them. Its army must still raise supplies and its administrative commissions govern the province; now it must also maintain the travelling court. Ming loyalism has acquired a centre to serve, and the host must bear the first costs of breaking with Hangzhou.\\n\\nEnvoys continue to arrive from the provinces and overseas states. Claims once debated in the Liyi Assembly and cabinet must now be sustained by military strength.','删除印信厅堂清册堆砌，写行在的政治与财政代价。','nesnd_ming_court.3 after actual refuge transfer; no invented immediate new taxes/military changes.')
short('nesnd_ming_court.9.d','湖广与四川尚无能够接驾的政府，朝廷只得留在南京。拥明大臣须继续争取地方支持，也须同掌握兵财的南府商议眼前的处境。郑氏的易代主张已摆在面前，留京廷议将决定我们还能争取多少余地。','Neither Huguang nor Sichuan can presently receive the court, which must remain in Nanjing. Ming loyalists must continue seeking provincial support while negotiating with Hangzhou, which controls the troops and revenues. The Zheng claim to the throne is already before us; deliberations in the capital will determine how much room remains to act.','具体接驾失败原因，不用文书道具代替政治冲突。')
short('nesnd_ming_court.10.t','诸省复议','The Provinces Reconsider')
short('nesnd_ming_court.10.d','反对新朝的地方尚未结成足以举兵的联盟。任官、赋额、军费与海外地位仍是各方争执的要害。南府要使郑氏的帝号为人接受，就须继续回应这些主张；拥明者也仍在寻找可以共进退的同道。','Opponents of the new dynasty have not formed a coalition capable of taking up arms. Appointments, taxation, military obligations and overseas status remain disputed. Hangzhou must keep answering those demands if Zheng rule is to win acceptance, while Ming loyalists continue seeking allies.','这是实际未形成反吴联盟，不是所有人已经签约。')
short('nesnd_ming_court.10.a','继续商议地方主张。','Continue negotiations over provincial demands.')
short('nesnd_ming_court.12.d','地方已经与中央决裂，预定接驾的政府却发生了变故。朝廷一时无法出京，拥明大臣只能继续联络湖广与四川，寻找能够保护天子、维持行朝的接应者。留在南京的每一日，都使我们更难摆脱南府的安排。','The provinces have broken with the centre, but circumstances have changed in the government chosen to receive the court. Unable to leave the capital, Ming loyalists must seek another host in Huguang or Sichuan capable of protecting the sovereign and maintaining the court. Every further day in Nanjing makes it harder to escape Hangzhou’s arrangements.')
short('nesnd_ming_seek_refuge_desc','再遣使者前往湖广与四川，寻求能够接驾并维护明统的地方政府。','Send envoys again to Huguang and Sichuan to find a government able to receive the court and uphold the Ming succession.','删除查询“核对条件”和状态维持实现说明。')
short('nesnd_ming_after_truce_reason','停战以后，朝廷仍未返回南京。拥明各省保有自己的军队与财赋，南府也没有放弃新朝的帝号。行在须休养财力、结交盟友，待有实力收复旧都时，再议天下的名分。','The truce has not returned the court to Nanjing. Ming loyalist provinces retain their armies and revenues, while Hangzhou has not abandoned its imperial claim. The court must rebuild its finances and seek allies before it can recover the old capital and settle the succession.')
# Reconciliation is domestic expenditure to fulfil accepted constitutional terms, while overseas treaties stay international.
short('nesnd_south_reconciliation','弥合朝争','Reconciling the Realm')
add('nesnd_south_reconciliation_reason','南朝诸省的军政关系经过陈东阳改制，已不同于北明旧日的藩镇。可是南府与西府之间的积怨，并不会随着一场礼议自行消失。各方既已支持同一路线，中央就须承担商定的行政经费，使礼法中拟定的权责能够真正施行。\\n\\n海外诸邦也在等待朝廷兑现承诺。逐月维持这些安排，才有机会让易代之争重新回到可以商议的地步。','Chen Dongyang’s reforms have carried the Southern provinces beyond the military fiefs of the old Northern Ming order. Yet a deliberation in the assembly cannot by itself dissolve the grievances between the Southern and Western Administrations. With the parties supporting the same settlement, the centre must meet the agreed administrative expenses and put its proposed distribution of powers into practice.\\n\\nOverseas states also await fulfilment of the court’s commitments. Sustaining these arrangements month by month may bring the succession dispute back within reach of negotiation.','去遍海帝国网络与账册化；不把中央施政写成诸府联盟的会办。','reconciliation basis strict political/accordgates, recurring wages+5% authority-50, monthly pressure-3 after1month; no extra tangible grants.')
short('nesnd_south_reconciliation_start','履行改制安排','Implement the Agreed Settlement')
short('nesnd_south_reconciliation_start_desc','承担改制所需的行政经费，协调中央与各省的施政，并兑现对海外诸邦的承诺。','Meet the administrative costs of reform, coordinate the centre and provinces, and fulfil commitments to overseas states.')
short('nesnd_south_reconciliation_stop','暂停履行','Suspend Implementation')
short('nesnd_south_reconciliation_stop_desc','停止为改制额外拨付行政经费。由此缓解朝争的努力也将中止。','Stop the additional administrative expenditure for the settlement, ending this effort to ease the court dispute.')
short('nesnd_south_reconciliation_cost','改制行政经费','Reform Administration')
short('nesnd_court_followup.19.d','易代之争已延续两年，朝廷仍未能使各方接受同一主张。南朝各省与海外诸邦继续按现有权力施政，拥明与拥吴的分歧也没有汇成一场共同的战争。\\n\\n我们可以就此停止此次国制交涉，承认眼前的疆界、政府与条约关系。谁也未能完成自己的改制目标，但至少不必再让天下等候一份迟迟不能议定的新法。','The succession dispute has lasted two years without a settlement acceptable to all parties. The Southern provinces and overseas states continue to exercise their existing powers, while the divide between Ming and Wu has not produced a common war.\\n\\nWe can close these constitutional negotiations and accept the present borders, governments and treaty relations. Neither side will have fulfilled its programme of reform, but the realm need no longer wait for a constitution that remains beyond agreement.','僵局结算不是新宪法/盟约通过；保留实际主权状态。','event19 -> inconclusive settlement; keeps borders/laws/treaties, no victory reward/integration.')
short('nesnd_court_followup.19.a','各安现状，休息生民。','Accept the present settlement and let the people recover.')
short('nesnd_south_inconclusive_order_desc','两年来未能议定新制，也未形成靖难对峙。承认各方现有疆界、政府与条约关系，结束此次易代交涉。','After two years without a new constitution or a Jingnan confrontation, accept the existing borders, governments and treaty relations and close the succession negotiations.')
short('nesnd_court_followup.15.d','易代以后，留在[ROOT.GetCountry.GetName]的朱氏宗亲仍有衣食与居处之需。新朝可以供养这些失去帝位的宗室，使他们保有身份，也让旧日追随者看见朝廷对前朝的处置。数百年皇统留下的人与事，终究不能随国号一同消失。','After the succession, the Zhu relatives remaining in [ROOT.GetCountry.GetName] still need homes and support. Providing for the former imperial family preserves their status and shows their old followers how the new government treats its predecessors. The people and obligations left by centuries of imperial rule cannot vanish with a change of dynasty.','不再用册籍/家谱/开支堆砌；不承诺恢复帝位。')
short('nesnd_court_followup.15.a','照例供养。','Provide their customary support.')
# Author crisis edits are legacy or generic; retain political stance and mark actual branch limitations.
short('nesnd_crisis.10.t','《诸省、大营布政以礼法行事疏》通过','The Memorial on Constitutional Administration Is Adopted')
short('nesnd_crisis.10.a','以法建国，国家堪成！','With law as its foundation, the state can stand!')
add('nesnd_crisis.10.d','各省学政在礼议院支持新法，任官、田赋与军费条陈由此写入南明的国家礼法。明廷保全了朱氏统绪，中央与各省的权责也有了共同认可的依据。\\n\\n陈东阳重设行省布政司时，南朝已能够统一调度军政，却没有一并解决旧封君的名位与地方权力。南、西两府面临北朝南下，曾以共同的军队压服不从。如今，因战事而暂且搁置的争执终于有了法定的处置办法。','Provincial representatives in the Liyi Assembly have supported the new provisions on appointments, land taxation and military funding, incorporating them into Southern Ming’s constitution. The Zhu succession endures, and the powers of the centre and provinces now rest on an accepted legal foundation.\\n\\nChen Dongyang’s restoration of provincial administrative commissions enabled common civil and military administration without fully resolving the status of former feudal lords and their local powers. Facing the northern advance, the Southern and Western Administrations had joined their armies to suppress resistance. Disputes then postponed by war have at last received a constitutional settlement.','作者稿精修；绝对多数/永久消灭所有地方权力无机制依据，改为支持新法和权力边界。','DORMANT: no current caller of nesnd_crisis.10; sole option has legacy cleanup+clemency, not constitution/integration. Prefer live20/22 prose; do NOT revive without removing duplicateeffects.')
short('nesnd_crisis.10.f','“诸省、大营，咸依礼法行事。”','“Let every province and garrison act according to the constitution.”','本轮拟写引文，不冒称已存在作者史料。','DORMANT fictional decree-style flavour; no named author attribution.')
short('nesnd_crisis.11.t','首辅门外','Outside the Chief Minister’s Residence')
add('nesnd_crisis.11.d','首辅护卫查获了一封伪造的换防手令。携信者与同伙很快被锦衣卫、大理寺捕获，分别收押；陈东阳先被送往安全之地，待案犯落网才返回住处。\\n\\n调查随后牵出经办军需、海运的官员，以及同他们往来的各省名绅与旧封君。大理寺主张公开案情，借此追究藏在官场中的关系；锦衣卫则坚持封锁消息，以免惊动尚未落网的人。内阁须决定如何继续查办，也须承担事情扩大后的政治后果。','The chief minister’s guards have intercepted a forged order changing the watch. The Embroidered Uniform Guard and Court of Judicial Review arrested its bearer and accomplices. Chen Dongyang was taken to safety and returned only after the suspects had been secured.\\n\\nThe investigation then implicated officials handling military procurement and shipping, together with their contacts among provincial gentry and former feudal lords. The Court of Judicial Review favours disclosure to expose their official connections; the Embroidered Uniform Guard insists on secrecy to avoid alerting suspects still at large. The cabinet must decide how to proceed and bear the political consequences.','保留作者刑部/大理寺/锦衣卫办案争议，修复碎句；当前不可见。','DORMANT: event11 hidden=yes, immediate securitymaintenance only. No public/secret option exists now; do not present as implemented alternate resolution.')
short('nesnd_crisis.11.a','公布案情，循线查办。','Publish the findings and pursue the investigation.')
short('nesnd_crisis.11.b','密查严查，一查到底！','Investigate in secret, and spare no one!')
short('nesnd_crisis.20.t','伪朝禅代','A Pretender Takes the Southern Throne')
add('nesnd_crisis.20.d','倭吴叛明称制的消息传来，江北大臣纷纷弹冠相庆。更有人提起牧家天子当年御辇南下的盛举。伪吴与西府诸省决裂互斗，若无暇北顾，南征统一或可一举成功。\\n\\n边将已经请求拨饷，并派人联络湖广的“有识之士”。然而，我朝也远非太平兴国之世。国内政务仍须军队与财力维持，地权改革若尚未完成，更难兼顾南征。此时卷入南朝的混战，究竟能为帝国赢得什么？','News that the despised Wu have cast off Ming and claimed the throne has brought celebration among ministers north of the river. Some recall the Mu sovereign’s great southern expedition. If the pretenders are consumed by fighting the Western provinces, a new campaign might reunify the realm in a single stroke.\\n\\nFrontier commanders have requested funds and contacted “men of understanding” in Huguang. Yet our own realm is far from settled. Domestic government still requires troops and money; unfinished land reform would make a southern expedition more burdensome still. What could the empire gain by entering this struggle now?','保留北朝敌视吴的阵营语气；原稿无条件说土改继续，事件实际可在土改后触发，改条件性。','event20 CNE; optiona observer; b HNAaid36mo+8disorder iff active; c intervention60mo+15iffactive and join oppositionplay.')
short('nesnd_crisis.20.c','联络襄樊，准备南下。','Contact Xiangfan and prepare to march south.','襄樊是据点/大营，不造“襄樊诸府”。')
short('nesnd_crisis.21.c','向反吴诸省提供军需。','Supply the provinces opposing Wu.')
short('nesnd_crisis.40.d','战事平定以后，地方军政陆续归入吴朝统辖。新朝须面对的已是怎样施政：被战争打断的生产与通商要恢复，各省百姓仍须生活，曾经反对郑氏的官员与士人也不会随战败一同消失。\\n\\n南府多年积累的军财足以支持重建。我们可以分案审理抵抗者，留用熟悉地方的人才；也可以借胜利清查旧党，使军队成为新秩序的支柱。无论如何处置，天下将从这些政令中认识郑氏自己的朝廷。','With the fighting ended, local civil and military authority is passing under Wu rule. The new dynasty must now govern: production and trade disrupted by war must recover, people need their livelihoods, and officials and scholars who opposed Zheng will not disappear with defeat.\\n\\nHangzhou’s accumulated military and fiscal strength can sustain reconstruction. We may judge opponents individually and retain experienced local officials, or use victory to purge the old parties and make the army the foundation of the new order. These decisions will show the realm what government in the Zheng family’s own name means.','作者English稿“伪南府”与吴胜利事件本方叙述相冲突，明确删伪；非擅改敌方立场。','event40: administration tax+5%bureaucracy+10%; leniency authority-5%turmoileffect-15%; repression authority+10%AFapproval+3intelligentsia-5+8%radicals;120months.')
short('nesnd_early_accession_desc','南府已经掌握南朝兵财。召集支持郑氏的臣僚，向明廷提出禅位之请，并要求各省与海外诸邦表明立场。','The Southern Administration commands the realm’s troops and revenues. Rally ministers supporting Zheng, petition the Ming court for abdication, and demand a response from the provinces and overseas states.','旧文“一并列入版籍”承诺不存在即时吞并；实际只是易代事件与表态链。')
short('flavorUSM.6.d','陈东阳已经去世。南朝共和派失去了主持改制的领袖，内阁及六部也须重新分派他留下的职权。各省学政还在礼议院争论新政的前途，南府却已开始争取那些失去领袖的官员。','Chen Dongyang is dead. Southern republicans have lost the leader of their reforms, while the cabinet and Six Ministries must redistribute his responsibilities. Provincial representatives still debate reform’s future in the Liyi Assembly, but Hangzhou is already courting the officials left without their leader.','当前flavorUSM.6触发需核：原改文“离开首辅”抹去死亡；此条需按实际调用确认后采用。','REVIEW REQUIRED: events/flavorUSM_ce.txt flavorUSM.6 is death followup; verify eventtrigger/after before apply.')
# Current province/civilwar wording; authors' unmodified historical passages remain preserved.
short('usm_civilwar.1.1','奉明正朔，联络各省！','Uphold Ming and rally the provinces!')
short('usm_civilwar.1.2','本省自理国政。','Let our government rule independently.','仅中国branch适用，海外或日本须保留本国；建议正文中泛称本国，选项改本国见report。')
P['usm_civilwar.1.2']['zh']='本国自理国政。'
add('usm_civilwar.1.d','郑氏已提出易代，要求各省与海外诸邦奉吴正朔。南府所掌军财使这项主张有了力量，朱氏数百年的帝统却仍有追随者；礼议院与内阁中未能平息的争执，终于传到了地方。\\n\\n[ROOT.GetCountry.GetName]须就此作答。承认吴朝，便接受郑氏以新礼法主持中央；举兵奉明，则须联络同道，准备抵抗南府军队。也有人主张趁此脱离原有隶属，由本国自行主持政务。','The Zheng family has demanded a new dynasty and recognition from the provinces and overseas states. Hangzhou’s military and fiscal power gives force to its claim, but the centuries-old Zhu succession still commands loyalty. The dispute unresolved in the Liyi Assembly and cabinet has now reached the provinces.\\n\\n[ROOT.GetCountry.GetName] must answer. Recognition accepts Zheng government under the new constitution; taking up arms for Ming requires allies and preparations against Hangzhou’s forces. Others would use the crisis to leave the existing hierarchy and govern independently.','避免尚未正式执行accession就称已有天子诏；国际国家与国内省分开。','usm_civilwar.1 invitation branch; response stance/support/autonomy, actual full options triggers apply.')
short('usm_civilwar.2.d','反对易代的檄文已经传开。吴朝调集中央军，要求地方承认郑氏统治；奉明各省则联络营伍，筹措共同作战的兵力与粮饷。曾共同抵御北朝的南府与西府，如今终于兵戎相见。\\n\\n江海商路将承载军队，也会因战争而受阻。海外属邦、邻国与远方的商人都须重新决定自己的去向。无论哪一方获胜，战后的政府都要面对参战者为其流血所提出的要求。','Proclamations against the succession have spread. Wu is assembling the central army to enforce recognition of Zheng rule; Ming loyalist provinces are gathering troops and supplies for common resistance. The Southern and Western Administrations, once united against the North, now face one another in arms.\\n\\nMaritime and river trade routes will carry armies and suffer the disruption of war. Overseas dependencies, neighbouring states and distant merchants must choose their course anew. Whoever wins will inherit the demands of those who shed blood for victory.')
short('usm_civilwar.3.t','易代未起兵戈','Accession Without a General War')
short('usm_civilwar.3.d','地方的反对尚未汇成共同举兵的联盟。仍然归顺的各省与海外诸邦承认郑氏的新名位，另有一些地方退出了原有隶属。南府得以继续主持中央，却不能因此把所有人的沉默都当作拥戴。\\n\\n新朝须按礼法任官施政，也须凭现有军财维护自己的统治。那些尚未解决的地方关系，将由往后的建设、交涉与争端逐渐决定。','Local opposition has failed to form a coalition for common war. Provinces and overseas states that remain loyal recognise Zheng rule, while others have left the previous hierarchy. Hangzhou can continue governing the centre, but cannot treat every silence as consent.\\n\\nThe new dynasty must appoint officials and govern under its constitution, while sustaining authority with the troops and revenues it possesses. Unresolved relations with the provinces and states will be shaped by future development, negotiation and conflict.','准确无共同反吴联盟不等于全体同意整合。')
short('usm_civilwar.10.d','联军已经击败吴朝的中央军。奉明的旗号曾使西府诸省与各方同道一同作战，如今胜利者却须回答另一件事：南京的中央政府将由谁主持？\\n\\n朱氏宗室仍有重返帝位的主张，获胜的地方领袖也不愿轻易交出军政大权。共和派则希望把并肩作战的国人带入新的议政制度。战时共同反吴的联盟能否容纳这些主张，将决定南朝此后的国制。','The coalition has defeated Wu’s central army. The Ming cause brought the Western provinces and their allies together; victory now raises another question: who will govern from Nanjing?\\n\\nThe Zhu house still claims the throne, while victorious provincial leaders are reluctant to surrender their military and political authority. Republicans want the citizens who fought together to share in a new deliberative government. Whether the wartime coalition can accommodate these demands will determine the Southern realm’s future constitution.','此处真正军事联盟保留联盟；不给各地议局赋予中央国会职权。')
short('usm_civilwar.13.d','[SCOPE.sCountry(\'usm_mister_rebel\').GetName]已遣使宣誓效忠，承认新中央的统辖。战时并肩作战的关系由此转为君臣名分，地方军政也将按重新议定的关系办理。','[SCOPE.sCountry(\'usm_mister_rebel\').GetName] has sent an envoy to swear allegiance and recognise the new centre. The wartime partnership has become a relationship of allegiance, under which local civil and military affairs will now be conducted.','去册籍道具；留实际country引用。')
# Assassination: live late override must carry author concerns, without conflating the disabled old investigation event.
short('nesnd_protect_chen_button','首辅警卫案','The Chief Minister’s Protection')
add('nesnd_protect_chen_button_desc','陈东阳主持的改制触及士族、旧封君与军官的田产和爵位。东关先生本人虽无所畏惧，朝廷却不能轻视这些敌意。安排专任护卫，并决定是否令他暂留官署、清查内应，以保全继续推动新政的力量。\\n\\n警卫任期#v 六个月#!。未设专卫时，本案死亡、负伤、脱险的概率为#v 40／25／35#!；详细经费与续办办法见警卫议案。','Chen Dongyang’s reforms threaten the estates and titles of gentry, former feudal lords and military officers. Master Dongguan may be fearless, but the court cannot disregard their hostility. Assign dedicated guards and consider keeping him at his residence or investigating insiders, preserving the leader needed to sustain reform.\\n\\nProtection lasts #v six months#!. Without dedicated guards, the case has death, injury and escape chances of #v 40/25/35#!. Funding and renewal terms appear in the protection proposal.','把用户保护改革领袖的动机接到真正后覆盖警卫按钮；保留真实有期限/风险，不恢复旧永久保护。','Live security panel event1;6monthguard; portrait/storylocationbranches; options guard/residence/intelligence; no oldcrisis11choices.')
add('nesnd_chen.1.d','陈东阳从西秦流亡南明，与吴王郑钦合力推动改制，国人共和派也由此进入南朝政权的中心。如今新政触及士族、旧封君和军官的田产与爵位，反诗、威胁信接连传来。东关先生仍以国事为念，内阁却不能把他的安危全托付给旧日同盟。\\n\\n朝廷可以给饷选派亲卫，也可以令首辅暂留官署，另行清查随从与接应人员。保护改革的领袖需要经费，也会使掌管警卫的内阁取得更多权力。\\n\\n$nesnd_chen.finance_rules$','Chen Dongyang came to Southern Ming as an exile from Western Qin and joined King Zheng Qin of Wu in reforming the state. Guoren republicans thereby entered the heart of Southern government. Reform now threatens the estates and titles of gentry, former feudal lords and officers; hostile verses and threatening letters continue to arrive. Master Dongguan remains absorbed in public affairs, but the cabinet cannot entrust his safety entirely to old alliances.\\n\\nThe court may fund a personal guard, keep him at his residence, or investigate his attendants and contacts. Protecting the leader of reform will cost money and place more power in the hands of the cabinet directing his guards.\\n\\n$nesnd_chen.finance_rules$','采用作者攻击改革领袖背景；删账册隐喻；保留具体代价与术语。','nesnd_chen.1 fallback before guard; finance_rules dynamic appendedunchanged.')
# Live trade journal: international agreements remain agreements; academy is political education.
add('nesnd_supply_preparations_reason','吴人的海船把南洋稻米、远方木材与各国货物运进南朝，内陆工坊、营伍与书院也早已依赖这些往来。各省虽保有不同的地方势力，生产和生计却已难以独立于共同市场。停下一处港口、截断一条商路，损失便会传到远方。\\n\\n明廷与南府争论帝统时，[ROOT.GetCountry.GetName]仍须维持自己的军政。官署要用纸，营伍要补兵添械，书院中的监生也正从讲席走向议政。我们既要同愿意往来的诸邦维持交易，又要使本地工坊、学校与乡里的生计经得住眼前的动荡。','Wu shipping brings grain from the Southern Seas, distant timber and foreign goods into the Southern realm. Inland workshops, garrisons and academies already depend on those exchanges. Provincial powers differ, but production and livelihoods can scarcely stand apart from the common market. Closing a port or severing a trade route spreads losses far beyond it.\\n\\nAs the Ming court and Hangzhou dispute the succession, [ROOT.GetCountry.GetName] must keep its government and forces functioning. Offices need paper, garrisons need recruits and arms, and academy students are preparing to enter political life. We must maintain trade with willing partners and make local workshops, schools and livelihoods capable of enduring the present disruption.','学校不是培养粮饷小吏；保留此JE确实建筑/商品/就业条件，不给没有HNA限定的日志硬塞襄阳唯一背景。','nesnd_supply JE shared HNA/SIH/GNG; genericacademymention fitsworld, HNAuniversityspecificjobs; nativeconditions supply/jobs/livelihood/contact12weeks.')
short('nesnd_supply_status_jobs_hna','#n 营伍与书院尚缺人手。#!襄樊军营须补足兵额，书院也须延揽教员，使监生能够读书议政。\\n$nesnd_supply_rules_link$','#n Garrisons and academies are understaffed.#! Xiangfan needs recruits, and its academies need teachers to prepare students for political life.\\n$nesnd_supply_rules_link$')
